# Character course sound events, read by SoundEventAssets at start.
# event <id> <group> <limit> <variants> <cooldown ticks> [weights]
# footstep <event> <stride mm>
# impact <event> <drop first heard mm> <drop at full gain mm>
# mood <id> <music> <effects> <ui> <ramp ms>, gains in permille
# music <cue> <fade out ms> <fade in ms>
# Ids match the CourseSounds::EVENT_*, MOOD_* and MUSIC_* constants.

# Weighted jump variants replay the same pick on a replayed tick.
seed 20260928

# Jump and land each keep one voice; jump prefers variant 0 three to one.
event 1 0 1 2 0  3 1   # jump
event 2 1 1 1 6        # land
# Win, fall and save share a stinger group, so a new result cuts off the last.
event 3 2 1 1 0        # win
event 4 2 1 1 0        # fall
event 5 2 1 1 0        # save
# Footsteps keep one voice of their own, so a step never cuts off a jump.
event 6 3 1 1 0        # footstep

# A step sounds every 0.65 m walked; a landing is heard from a 0.3 m drop
# and at full gain from 2.4 m.
footstep 6 650
impact 2 300 2400

# Mix moods: play at full gain, pause ducks music and effects, and the
# controls menu ducks the music further. Each ramps in over 250 ms.
mood 0 1000 1000 1000 250   # play
mood 1 450 300 1000 250     # paused
mood 2 200 300 1000 250     # menu

# Music cues: a win fades the course loop out over 0.6 s while the victory
# loop swells in over 1.5 s. A restart cuts straight back to the course loop.
music 0 600 800    # course
music 1 400 1500   # victory
